'''Beam Park''' is an electoral ward in the [[London Borough of Havering]]. The ward was first used in the [[2022 London local elections|2022 elections]]. It returns two councillors to [[Havering London Borough Council]].

The ward includes the eastern part of the new neighbourhood of [[Beam Park]], [[Orchard Village]] and part of [[South Hornchurch]].

